  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to reduce the impact of natural hazards on vulnerable community members. It increases the resilience of communities to disasters, climate change and environmental degradation. Projects also increase the capacity of civil society organisations (CSO&apos;s) to&#xa0;cope with these natural hazards.</narrative>
  </description>
